  "description": "One of Fuji's oldest models,\n\nthe Newest is brand new for 2001. Lighter and more responsive than ever, it's\n\nas versatile as ever, thanks to its three chain rings.\n\nThe new Newest's racing geometry frame is made from Fuji Custom Butted 7005-Series\n\naluminum tubing in three diameters. The rear end of the frame, the seat and\n\nchain stays, is Custom tapered aluminum. The fork is Fuji's Triple-butted,\n\nTapered Cro-Moly steel, smooth and aero-shaped.\n\nA Newest will ride like a Roubaix, quick, solid and reassuring on the road. Bolted onto the Newest frame are Shimano's proven Tiagra\n\ncomponents. Three chain rings means plenty of gears, their ratios chosen for\n\nflexibility, for wherever your Newest adventures might take you. Strong 32-spoke\n\nwheels with sturdy stainless steel spokes and Mavic rims, Michelin Axial Bi-Sport\n\ntires, a threadless roller-bearing headset... Newest is good to go.\n\nFast fun. Fuji Newest.",
